# Over WebRTC data channels between Chromium browsers (dcSCTP at both ends), the holders through a
# halving: rtc-holders-chromium-all's shape on halve.sched's step, the seed's uplink 10 Mbit/s (42 %
# load) to 5 (84 %) 15 s in, as in the browser tier's halve cells. Two holders take 64 KiB every
# 250 ms in 4 KiB writes, eight idle links a 128-byte write after each burst starts, and every link a
# probe every 200 ms, phases spread.
# env: VIEWERS=10 SEED_UP_MBIT=10 SECS=40 SEED_UP_STEPS=15:5 BENCH_WEBRTC=1 KINDS="chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium chromium"
burst 0 1 0 250 65536 4096
burst 0 2 0 250 65536 4096
burst 0 3 1 250 128 128
burst 0 4 1 250 128 128
burst 0 5 1 250 128 128
burst 0 6 1 250 128 128
burst 0 7 1 250 128 128
burst 0 8 1 250 128 128
burst 0 9 1 250 128 128
burst 0 10 1 250 128 128
probe 0 1 7 200
probe 0 2 47 200
probe 0 3 17 200
probe 0 4 37 200
probe 0 5 57 200
probe 0 6 77 200
probe 0 7 97 200
probe 0 8 117 200
probe 0 9 137 200
probe 0 10 157 200
